<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>小智 · 电商智能客服</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css" />
</head>
<body>
  <div id="app">
    <header id="topbar">
      <div class="brand">
        <span class="mark"></span>
        <span class="brand-name">小智</span>
        <span class="brand-sub">电商智能客服 · 会查单 · 会引用 · 会拒答</span>
      </div>
      <div class="top-right">
        <a class="top-link" href="/admin/topics">主题分布</a>
        <a class="top-link" href="/admin/review">飞轮审核</a>
        <button id="conv-toggle" class="icon-btn" type="button" title="会话列表" aria-label="会话列表">
          <svg width="13" height="11" viewBox="0 0 13 11" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M1 1.5h11M1 5.5h11M1 9.5h7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.4" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </button>
        <button id="new-chat" class="btn-ghost" type="button">+ 新对话</button>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main id="messages" class="stream" aria-live="polite"></main>

    <footer id="composer">
      <div class="input-row">
        <input id="input" type="text" placeholder="问点什么吧，如：邮费是多少 / 订单1001的物流到哪了" autocomplete="off" />
        <button id="send" type="button">发送</button>
      </div>
      <div class="composer-note">
        <span>小智是 AI 助手，涉及资金与工单的操作会先请你确认。</span>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div id="scrim"></div>

  <aside id="conv-drawer" class="drawer" aria-label="会话列表">
    <div class="drawer-head">
      <span class="drawer-title">会话</span>
      <button id="conv-close" class="drawer-close" type="button" title="关闭">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer-body" id="conv-list"></div>
    <div class="conv-foot">同一浏览器的历史会话</div>
  </aside>

  <aside id="source-panel" class="drawer" aria-label="来源原文">
    <div class="drawer-head">
      <span class="drawer-title">来源原文</span>
      <button id="source-close" class="drawer-close" type="button" title="关闭">✕</button>
    </div>
    <div class="drawer-body" id="source-body"></div>
  </aside>

  <script src="/chat.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
